{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1333884-command-battle-groups-question","id":1333884,"title":"Command/Battle Groups Question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-09-03T14:59:23-07:00","id":1333884,"title":"Command/Battle Groups Question","content":"&quot;At five dots, this Merit provides either a Size 5, Might 0<br /> group with Elite Drill and the traits of elite rather than<br /> average troops, or five Size 5, might 0 groups with Average<br /> Drill, or two Size 5, Might 0 groups with Elite Drill.&quot;<br /> <br /> I have a question about this merit at 5 dots. Essentially, I can take 5 Size 5 - Average troops, 2 Size 5 Elite troops, or 1 Size 5 Elite Troop with Elite traits. What does this last one mean? I can't find an explanation in the Battle groups section of the core.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25538-jancarius","name":"Jancarius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25538_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-03T15:09:05-07:00","id":1333887,"title":"","content":"These are profils of NPC in the Core Exalted Book if I'm not mistaken. Basically the ones without Elite traits are avreage soldier from the NPC chapter in the Core Book, and the ones with Elite traits are Elite soldiers from the NPC chapter in the Core Book","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-03T15:40:33-07:00","id":1333894,"title":"","content":"The ones on page 497? So the Elite single unit would attack with 4 more dice and have a higher parry, etc, compared to the other 2?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25538-jancarius","name":"Jancarius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25538_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-03T15:44:03-07:00","id":1333895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jancarius</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1333884-command-battle-groups-question?p=1333894#post1333894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The ones on page 497? So the Elite single unit would attack with 4 more dice and have a higher parry, etc, compared to the other 2?</div> </div> </div> </div>Bingo. Average tropps are on page 496, or at least they start there, and elite troops on page 497. Then add all the bonuses for size and drill to their statistics and you have their stats for the size 5 battlegroup.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-04T01:51:39-07:00","id":1333930,"title":"","content":"Elite troops are (obviously) way better.<br /> <br /> But training Charms can raise the stats of Average troops to Elite troops pretty trivially.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}